 time </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "It’s 1986, and you’re stranded in the Bermuda Triangle -- but not alone. Trapped in a terrifying loop with a monster, you’ll have to stay one step ahead to survive and uncover the truth. Ready or not, here it comes.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547420/9f6acf19d3c611482c98e9465631bc7611b1a263/header.jpg?t=1761670335", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547420/ca3d3bd8f650b94bf771e87eba592013dff717c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761670335", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547420/ca3d3bd8f650b94bf771e87eba592013dff717c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761670335", "website": "http://playire.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9500/ AMD Ryzen 5 3500x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1660 Ti 6GB / AMD Radeon Radeon RX 5500XT 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Surround Sound<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and Operating System</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-11700k/ AMD Ryzen 7 5700x3d<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 3070 8GB / AMD Radeon 